{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0dvb2QlMjBMdWNrJTIwQ2h1Y2slMjAlMjgyMDA3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Good Luck Chuck","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/b2VgUoXR9iAtAf8nA0mvdTr7cOt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5R4kLw5lxeiwX5hZfspK3YLg6wp.jpg","description":"Cursed since childhood, dentist Charlie Logan cannot find the right woman. Even worse, he learns that each of his ex-girlfriends finds true love with the man she meets after her relationship with him ends. Hearing of Charlie's reputation as a good-luck charm, women from all over line up for a quick tryst. But when Charlie meets the woman of his dreams, he must find a way to break the curse or risk losing her to the next man she meets.","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"96 min","cast":["Dane Cook","Jessica Alba","Dan Fogler","Ellia English","Lonny Ross","Troy Gentile","Chelan Simmons","Mackenzie Mowat"],"director":["Mark Helfrich"],"released":"2007-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"He has to break his curse before she breaks his heart.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Dane Cook","character":"Dr. Charlie Logan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4UGHKnDOf75GZR5z0QHjrhjfpIu.jpg"},{"name":"Jessica Alba","character":"Cam Wexler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hPoy6FRfiCIxguX3w2CoBbDoaEV.jpg"},{"name":"Dan Fogler","character":"Dr. Stu Klaminsky","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zJWbLEjfbDthBMucq9M6L4GJXL3.jpg"},{"name":"Ellia English","character":"Reba","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y1rk8Y1qnL96OiTBvuKE8zkkv31.jpg"},{"name":"Lonny Ross","character":"Joe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6yO8KB9b3yoE5HjhVu8YWViQlX5.jpg"},{"name":"Troy Gentile","character":"Young Stu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lC2BtCSI5lcaJribUjTRXg1cCuW.jpg"},{"name":"Chelan Simmons","character":"Carol","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pnIEDV1